GNU FriBidi 1.0.16: the Unicode bidirectional algorithm, as Pango calls it
(fribidi_get_par_embedding_levels_ex with bracket types), for BUI's text
engine (gpu/intern/gpu_text_unicode.inc.c).

Only the bidi part of lib/ is kept, unchanged: fribidi-bidi.c,
fribidi-bidi-types.c, fribidi-brackets.c, fribidi-mirroring.c,
fribidi-run.c, their headers and the generated Unicode tables (*.tab.i,
from the release tarball). fribidi-config.h stands in for the generated
one. Built with hidden symbols (gpu/CMakeLists.txt).
License: COPYING (LGPL-2.1-or-later).
